WEBVTT

00:03:56.297 --> 00:04:00.730
Something that relates the pedals
to the chain and to the wheels.

00:04:01.563 --> 00:04:05.930
But when you ask people to explain
how a bicycle works,

00:04:05.963 --> 00:04:08.430
they produce drawings like this.

00:04:10.463 --> 00:04:11.697
And like this.

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:13.397
(Laughter)

00:04:13.797 --> 00:04:17.297
People have no idea how bicycles work.

00:04:17.297 --> 00:04:20.663
Or zippers or rainbows,

00:04:20.697 --> 00:04:23.797
or even topics they argue
passionately about.

00:04:24.197 --> 00:04:27.530
When you push people to explain
how these things work,

00:04:27.563 --> 00:04:29.063
they usually can't.

00:04:29.963 --> 00:04:33.030
Just caring about something,
like parenting,